-- title:
--   The responders to the next commit above a publication include a quorum of its accepted configuration
-- statement:
--   For all `P`, every cluster `W` with `Inv P W`, every sent publication `W.sent (.publishRequest srcD sD ptD pvD)` and every committed key `(ct, cv)` (`Committed W ct cv`) with `Descends W sD.term sD.version ct cv`, `¬ (sD.term = ct ∧ sD.version = cv)`, and no committed key strictly between (every committed `(ft, fv)` with `Descends W sD.term sD.version ft fv` and `Descends W ft fv ct cv` is `(sD.term, sD.version)` or `(ct, cv)`): there is a list `A` with `RespVoters P W ct cv A` (eligible nodes that each sent a `PublishResponse` for `(ct, cv)`) and `sD.lastAcceptedConfiguration.hasQuorum A = true`.
